WEBVTT

00:04.004 --> 00:07.007
I really, really hate you.

00:07.090 --> 00:10.218
I hate you so much, I could kill you.

00:10.301 --> 00:13.054
Hey, what are you two doing?

00:13.138 --> 00:15.181
I'll murder you both.

00:15.265 --> 00:18.643
H-Hey! What are you gonna do to Nagumo?

00:19.352 --> 00:22.021
If you want to hurt Nagumo,
you'll have to face me!

00:23.565 --> 00:28.069
Looks like that magic turns
our emotions the exact opposite.

00:28.820 --> 00:32.574
Proportional to how strong
the original feeling is.

00:32.657 --> 00:36.453
Yeah. I hate that I agree with you…

00:37.620 --> 00:39.622
But your judgment is spot on.

00:39.706 --> 00:41.249
I see.

00:41.875 --> 00:48.214
Dispel our reversed emotions, and return
to normal through our bonds and memories,

00:48.298 --> 00:51.760
or put faith in our past trust,

00:51.843 --> 00:56.347
and tackle
this challenge still hating each other.

00:57.515 --> 00:59.434
What a dirty trial.

00:59.517 --> 01:03.229
The nastiest part is
that the stronger the bond,

01:03.313 --> 01:07.817
the more hate there is once reversed.

01:07.901 --> 01:08.985
And most of all…

01:09.069 --> 01:10.945
They look so adorable.

01:11.029 --> 01:13.114
Yes, how adorable.

01:13.782 --> 01:18.578
Why did I get so worked up
trying to kill such cute creatures?

01:19.162 --> 01:24.375
Their twitching antennae, their shiny
bodies, their skittering legs.

01:24.459 --> 01:25.543
How lovely.

01:25.627 --> 01:29.464
Yeah, they really are adorable. Then…

01:29.547 --> 01:33.426
Yep. Absolutely lovely. So for now…

01:33.510 --> 01:34.761
Die!

01:37.347 --> 01:43.728
ARIFURETA: FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

03:05.977 --> 03:10.940
EPISODE 8: GRAB HOLD OF HOPE

03:15.528 --> 03:16.863
So sad.

03:16.946 --> 03:20.450
We wouldn't have to kill them
if they weren't our enemies.

03:20.533 --> 03:21.951
How unfortunate.

03:22.035 --> 03:25.914
Hey, pipsqueak.
I'm gonna kill that big one.

03:25.997 --> 03:27.165
Don't get in my way.

03:27.248 --> 03:28.791
Who do you think you are?

03:28.875 --> 03:30.376
You should be the one to back off.

03:30.460 --> 03:32.045
I'll kill you if you get in my way.

03:40.595 --> 03:42.805
So cute!

03:46.184 --> 03:47.227
Hey, Suzu!

03:51.189 --> 03:52.941
Get a grip, all of you!

03:53.983 --> 03:55.652
Why did you come all this way?

03:56.653 --> 03:59.239
To surrender yourselves to
the enemies we need to take down?!

03:59.322 --> 04:01.074
I-I'm sorry.

04:01.157 --> 04:02.742
Spare me the apologies.

04:02.825 --> 04:04.202
Do your job.

04:04.285 --> 04:07.622
You're here to protect us
with your barriers, are you not?

04:07.705 --> 04:08.623
Y-Yes!

04:08.706 --> 04:11.793
She's just like the legendary dragonfolk!

04:11.876 --> 04:13.670
Who exactly are you?!

04:13.753 --> 04:17.215
Y-You two, how rude can you…

04:17.298 --> 04:19.509
Maybe I brought it upon myself.

04:19.592 --> 04:22.762
Whatever! Don't worry about me!

04:22.845 --> 04:24.430
The spell will end soon.

04:24.514 --> 04:26.307
Keep your eyes forward!

04:32.897 --> 04:36.442
Oh, they're going for those two, huh?

04:37.443 --> 04:43.950
Looks like they can't afford to split off
while facing Master and Yue.

04:44.951 --> 04:47.870
But we've still got enemies to face!

04:47.954 --> 04:49.122
Hey, now!

04:49.205 --> 04:52.000
Now's not the time to complain
about killing them!

04:52.083 --> 04:53.751
-It's kill or be killed!
-What?

04:54.419 --> 04:56.754
You're going to fight something so cute?!

04:56.838 --> 04:59.007
Koki, we need to.

04:59.632 --> 05:02.677
Didn't you hear them?
Our emotions are reversed.

05:03.344 --> 05:06.764
What we feel now is not our true feelings.

05:07.724 --> 05:09.017
We'll die if we don't kill them.

05:09.100 --> 05:10.935
S-Still…

05:11.019 --> 05:12.979
That's right, we have Nagumo!

05:13.062 --> 05:15.481
If we defend as hard
as we can without killing them,

05:15.565 --> 05:17.567
Nagumo will take care of everything!

05:19.986 --> 05:21.863
Hi-yah!

05:23.698 --> 05:26.284
You won't get away with ignoring me!

05:26.367 --> 05:27.744
Both the twerp and the sadist!

05:31.039 --> 05:34.375
Take this, you needy pests!

05:36.753 --> 05:40.048
I hate that I can't wipe these guys out.

05:40.131 --> 05:42.467
Shea's amazing.

05:43.468 --> 05:46.262
Unlike me with my borrowed powers.

05:46.345 --> 05:50.892
I thought you overcame those
emotions back in Melusine.

05:50.975 --> 05:51.809
What?

05:52.435 --> 05:56.814
No matter the method,
the power you've obtained is yours.

05:56.898 --> 06:00.735
Not to mention you gained that power
by giving up your own body.

06:00.818 --> 06:02.820
So don't look so gloomy.

06:06.824 --> 06:09.452
Take pride in yourself, Kaori.

06:09.952 --> 06:15.083
Your devotion, your effort,
and the fact that you're standing here.

06:15.166 --> 06:17.126
That's worthy of your pride.

06:19.504 --> 06:20.713
Shut up!

06:20.797 --> 06:23.466
I don't need you to tell me that, Tio!

06:23.549 --> 06:27.345
Besides, Shea's pretty special herself.

06:27.428 --> 06:29.430
She can't be compared to anyone else.

06:30.640 --> 06:31.766
Don't get me wrong.

06:32.475 --> 06:35.269
I'm not talking about her abilities.

06:35.353 --> 06:37.105
I mean her spirit.

06:37.188 --> 06:39.482
-Her spirit?
-Yes, that's right.

06:39.565 --> 06:41.567
Shea is a rabbitfolk.

06:41.651 --> 06:45.029
They love peace
and make for poor fighters.

06:45.113 --> 06:46.489
But Shea…

06:46.572 --> 06:49.033
She stepped forward
while cowering in fear,

06:49.117 --> 06:51.452
and fought with tears in her eyes.

06:51.536 --> 06:55.456
Standing beside her friends
and the people she loves.

06:57.208 --> 07:02.004
It appears that the world has
granted Koki the title of "hero",

07:02.088 --> 07:06.676
but if you ask me, Koki, and even
Master himself,

07:06.759 --> 07:08.386
is not worthy of that title.

07:09.303 --> 07:12.223
The one with true bravery in her heart…

07:12.306 --> 07:13.766
The real hero…

07:13.850 --> 07:15.351
Hey, Tio.

07:15.852 --> 07:18.354
Are your emotions really reversed?

07:18.438 --> 07:20.481
I don't like any of you.

07:20.565 --> 07:23.651
Even now, I'm filled with loathing.

07:24.485 --> 07:28.573
-But you know, what does that matter?
-Huh?

07:28.656 --> 07:33.369
If I were swayed by
my feelings of like or dislike,

07:33.453 --> 07:35.663
I wouldn't have survived
five hundred years.

07:35.746 --> 07:38.291
Faced with a task before me,

07:38.374 --> 07:41.627
my own feelings are a trifling matter.

07:41.711 --> 07:45.673
I may not like you,
but my memories tell me…

07:46.924 --> 07:51.929
That everyone here
is someone I must protect.

07:53.139 --> 07:54.223
Kaori.

07:54.307 --> 07:57.518
I'll be the one to protect you.

07:57.602 --> 08:03.065
In the name of the black dragon
Tio Klarus, with the job of Protector.

08:03.733 --> 08:07.487
I-It's fine! I can fight on my own!

08:10.573 --> 08:12.325
Shizuku!

08:15.661 --> 08:17.038
Kaori…

08:17.121 --> 08:19.499
Go on, stand up, Shizuku.

08:19.582 --> 08:21.375
There's no time to be resting.

08:21.459 --> 08:24.253
Huh? Ah, yeah.

08:25.379 --> 08:26.756
It's okay.

08:27.340 --> 08:29.509
I'll be the one to protect you.

08:33.513 --> 08:35.056
Thanks, Kaori.

08:35.765 --> 08:41.020
-It's okay. I've got your back covered.
-Yeah!

08:41.103 --> 08:44.565
Tio! Shizuku and I will
take care of things here!

08:44.649 --> 08:45.983
Take the other side!

08:46.067 --> 08:48.486
Yes, got it! Shea!

08:48.569 --> 08:50.530
I'll handle things above!

09:12.176 --> 09:14.720
Every move you make is so cute…

09:14.804 --> 09:16.389
But die!

09:56.387 --> 09:57.847
Is it dead?

09:57.930 --> 10:00.766
Who are you talking about?

10:00.850 --> 10:03.352
Couldn't be me, could it?

10:04.729 --> 10:07.815
D-Damn you…
You were trying to take me out, too?!

10:07.898 --> 10:09.191
I'm kidding.

10:09.275 --> 10:12.903
It'd be a lot easier
if that's all it took to kill you.

10:28.419 --> 10:32.173
So it can absorb
the small ones to regenerate?

10:32.256 --> 10:36.802
It's made up of those tiny bugs,
so I guess it's only natural.

10:44.518 --> 10:46.896
-Hey, now…
-It rotted away?

10:53.069 --> 10:55.613
An air slash with shockwaves?

11:06.248 --> 11:08.084
Didn't finish it off?

11:08.167 --> 11:10.878
Who are you talking about?

11:10.961 --> 11:15.716
-Couldn't be me, could it?
-I'm kidding.

11:15.800 --> 11:19.678
It'd be a lot easier if that's
all it took to kill you.

11:33.651 --> 11:34.735
Unleash.

11:55.714 --> 11:58.134
Oh, I get it now.

11:58.217 --> 12:00.261
Like I thought, you're an apostle of God.

12:00.344 --> 12:01.512
Fine by me.

12:21.991 --> 12:22.992
Did you take it down?

12:23.075 --> 12:27.371
No, although I did shatter
all its magic stones…

12:33.502 --> 12:37.423
Looks like I was right on the money.

12:37.506 --> 12:40.968
Yeah. It's like an army of Kaoris.
A nightmare.

12:41.051 --> 12:43.053
Don't drag me down.

12:43.137 --> 12:45.264
That's my line.

12:55.691 --> 12:58.569
You're not getting through that easily!

13:04.533 --> 13:05.784
Devastation!

13:23.552 --> 13:24.803
Heavensfall.

13:33.687 --> 13:35.189
Flame Missiles!

13:57.378 --> 13:58.921
Where are your Celestial Dragons?

13:59.004 --> 14:01.257
The enemy moves too quickly.

14:01.340 --> 14:04.134
They'd be too big.
Figure that out yourself!

14:04.218 --> 14:06.720
Didn't they split up before?

14:06.804 --> 14:09.598
Make it Ten Thousand
Celestial Dragons instead of five.

14:09.682 --> 14:11.350
That's not efficient.

14:11.433 --> 14:12.935
Are you stupid? Wanna die?

14:13.769 --> 14:18.065
Since you're saying all that,
you must have an efficient idea, right?

14:18.148 --> 14:19.900
Of course, what of it?

14:19.984 --> 14:22.152
Then get to it already!

14:22.236 --> 14:25.948
I'm preparing.
It's extremely advanced magic.

14:34.999 --> 14:36.375
Oh, no, you don't!

14:48.262 --> 14:49.388
So, Yue.

14:49.972 --> 14:52.725
How much longer
for that trump card of yours?

14:53.976 --> 14:56.687
If you can protect me,
twenty more seconds.

14:57.271 --> 15:00.441
-So the spell is broken?
-Yeah. You too?

15:00.524 --> 15:03.277
Yeah. I wouldn't call it hate anymore.

15:03.944 --> 15:06.739
Now you're just a cocky brat
who gets on my nerves.

15:06.822 --> 15:08.407
How mean!

15:09.783 --> 15:11.577
Huh? That's how you react?!

15:12.244 --> 15:13.495
Look at you sweat.

15:14.455 --> 15:15.998
Get on with it already.

15:20.419 --> 15:22.880
You won't lay a finger on Yue.

15:22.963 --> 15:25.341
Limit Break: Overload!

15:36.685 --> 15:39.188
Seriously, right at the very end?

15:44.193 --> 15:48.072
To beat down the apostles
of God swarming forth…

15:48.155 --> 15:51.408
The only way is to give the god
at the root a good beating, huh?

15:58.374 --> 15:59.541
Wait.

15:59.625 --> 16:05.339
If that's the case, there's a source here
underground that we should be beating up.

16:09.843 --> 16:11.261
Last five seconds!

16:21.438 --> 16:22.481
Count zero!

16:23.232 --> 16:24.441
Cull.

16:31.073 --> 16:33.283
Divine Purgatory!

16:57.975 --> 17:00.352
Looks like the source
was destroyed as well.

17:00.436 --> 17:01.520
Yeah.

17:01.603 --> 17:06.734
Still, being able to destroy
only the things you select…

17:06.817 --> 17:08.444
What an incredible spell.

17:08.527 --> 17:10.863
-Good job, Yue.
-Hajime.

17:14.199 --> 17:15.576
Time to eat.

17:20.330 --> 17:23.459
Yue! Hajime!

17:24.835 --> 17:26.295
Are you okay?

17:26.378 --> 17:29.882
-Yeah.
-Well, we weren't!

17:30.549 --> 17:34.094
Tio was acting all cool,
and it was really creepy.

17:34.178 --> 17:38.348
Tio was really grown-up,
and it had us scared!

17:38.432 --> 17:41.977
You girls! How rude can you get?!

17:42.061 --> 17:43.687
But it gets me worked up!

17:44.480 --> 17:46.940
-She's as bizarre as always.
-Yeah.

17:59.745 --> 18:03.082
I really hope that was the final trial…

18:16.428 --> 18:18.305
Hey, Nagumo. Is that it?

18:21.266 --> 18:22.976
Wait, Amanogawa.

18:27.815 --> 18:29.900
My word, Master.

18:30.984 --> 18:34.696
It looks like we're
at the top of the Grand Tree.

18:34.780 --> 18:36.240
I see.

18:36.323 --> 18:40.953
We couldn't see it from the Fenrir
because of concealment magic.

18:41.537 --> 18:48.335
Yeah. Spatial magic to bend light,
or maybe space itself has been displaced.

18:48.961 --> 18:50.879
Or perhaps spirit magic.

18:50.963 --> 18:53.966
Altering our perception
on the spiritual level.

18:54.591 --> 18:57.094
Looks like this is our goal.

19:15.362 --> 19:19.116
Fine work overcoming
the various labyrinths,

19:19.783 --> 19:26.248
as well as the trials
prepared by me, Lyutillis Haltina.

19:27.708 --> 19:32.254
You have my utmost respect,

19:32.337 --> 19:37.634
as well as my deepest apologies for
the terribly harsh trials you've endured.

19:38.844 --> 19:43.432
The relationship between us and the gods,

19:43.515 --> 19:45.309
the tragedies of the past,

19:45.392 --> 19:48.270
as well as what is happening now…

19:48.353 --> 19:51.273
You all have full understanding
of these, do you not?

19:52.691 --> 19:54.484
It is for that reason

19:54.568 --> 20:00.532
that I wanted you to know of unwavering
bonds, and hearts that may waver.

20:01.200 --> 20:06.246
The ancient magic I grant you,
evolution magic,

20:06.330 --> 20:10.667
can upgrade all of your powers
by at least one level.

20:11.168 --> 20:13.795
Just as you have been taught.

20:14.463 --> 20:19.801
However, the true worth
of this magic lies elsewhere.

20:21.053 --> 20:26.308
Evolution magic, as its name
suggests, can evolve all forms of magic.

20:26.391 --> 20:30.979
Creation magic.
Gravity magic. Spirit magic.

20:31.063 --> 20:36.068
Metamorphosis magic. Spatial magic.
Regeneration magic.

20:36.151 --> 20:40.322
By upgrading all of these to
the next level, and combining them,

20:40.405 --> 20:44.117
you can attain magic that
surpasses ancient magic.

20:44.201 --> 20:48.830
The magic of the gods themselves,
concept magic.

20:48.914 --> 20:50.791
Concept magic…

20:50.874 --> 20:56.338
Magic that allows you to manifest
and apply all manner of concepts.

20:56.421 --> 21:02.135
However, even after obtaining
all forms of ancient magic,

21:02.219 --> 21:05.097
it's not a magic so easily learned.

21:05.847 --> 21:07.057
After all,

21:07.140 --> 21:13.605
concept magic is born not from
theory, but the extremities of willpower.

21:14.523 --> 21:17.734
Even with all seven of us
Liberators combined,

21:17.818 --> 21:22.447
we only managed to produce
three concept magic spells.

21:23.448 --> 21:28.036
I will grant you one of those three.

21:34.835 --> 21:38.380
It is called the Everguiding Compass.

21:38.964 --> 21:44.011
The concept within points
toward one's wishes.

21:45.721 --> 21:49.766
If you wish,
it can lead you to that place.

21:49.850 --> 21:51.977
The location of someone you seek,

21:52.060 --> 21:54.896
the whereabouts of a hidden object,

21:55.564 --> 21:56.648
or even…

21:57.190 --> 21:59.651
A different world altogether.

23:35.956 --> 23:38.667
<i>Next time, "Changing Heart".</i>
